  "masked_text": "[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00141:f3c7b6b7d5fb]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00142:d4cb2bc36190]]\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00143:ab452bea72eb]] 牛顿运动、弹簧阻尼、刚体平衡、摩擦与重力模块；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00144:ab452bea72eb]] Logistic、捕食—被捕食、SIR/SIS、药物房室、Newton 冷却模块；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00145:ab452bea72eb]] 热、波、扩散和多孔流方程的 FDM 基线及 FEM 对照；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00146:ab452bea72eb]] Euler、RK4、自适应积分接口和统一误差指标；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00147:ab452bea72eb]] 网格加密、守恒残差、量纲检查、参数回代和结果导出；\n  [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00148:ab452bea72eb]] 2022A、2023A、2024A、2025A/B 的最小复现实验。\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00149:66cee2ed8c14]]\n\n",
